                      https://ffmpeg.org
  x264 (stable)       GPL-2.0-or-later
                      https://code.videolan.org/videolan/x264
  FreeType 2.14.3     FreeType License (FTL)
                      https://freetype.org
  HarfBuzz 13.0.0     Old MIT License
                      https://harfbuzz.github.io
  zlib 1.3.2          zlib License
                      https://zlib.net
  Inter 4.1           SIL Open Font License 1.1 (assets/Inter-OFL.txt)
                      https://rsms.me/inter
